WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
- Sara, who do you think is the most...

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.080
You know, most likely to trip?

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.160
- Well, I don't know.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.540
I guess, I would agree

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:09.930
that, you know,

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.683
I think we all have really clumsy moments.

00:00:11.683 --> 00:00:12.516
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:12.516 --> 00:00:14.307
I'm honest, it pops in my mind

00:00:14.307 --> 00:00:19.307
when Busy hit Renee in the
face with a salad bowl.

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:21.030
- What?

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:21.863
- Yes.

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:23.376
- Wait, what'd you do?

00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:25.813
- Oh my God. I almost forgot.

00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:27.531
- We... We had some-

00:00:27.531 --> 00:00:31.631
- We were shooting a scene in a closet,

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.820
and there was a gag

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.810
where she was supposed
to, you know, spill...

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.010
toss the salad as it were.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.837
And the next thing I
know, I was like, "God!"

00:00:42.802 --> 00:00:45.059
- Oh my gosh. Okay, so then it-

00:00:45.059 --> 00:00:45.892
- Wait.

00:00:45.892 --> 00:00:48.733
- The shot of me talking
like this is still in it.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.693
- Well, it was-

00:00:50.693 --> 00:00:51.987
- But the best part

00:00:51.987 --> 00:00:55.040
was Renee asking us like,
"You, guys is it bad?

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:55.873
Is it bad?"

00:00:55.873 --> 00:00:59.140
And it's like her lip is
like four times the size.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.328
And we're just like, "No, it's fine."

00:01:00.328 --> 00:01:01.161
- Lying.

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:01.994
- "It looks great. It
looks totally normal.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:03.387
It's totally normal."

00:01:03.387 --> 00:01:04.220
- They're all lying.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.560
No. Just keep acting

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.950
- And I, I walked in after
the whole thing happened

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.210
and it was a very weird energy on the set.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.760
Everyone was whispering.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.150
She got a giant bag of ice

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:16.950
on her face and Busy was
kind of pacing around.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:18.110
- See, this is what I imagined.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:22.267
Girl groups are like, I know
you can't laugh until later

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:24.592
but then you laugh hysterically

00:01:24.592 --> 00:01:26.190
because you've been
holding it for a minute.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.890
Cause you want it to laugh before.

